                <pb facs="0265" n="185" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg185"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. White to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Embassy of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-08-05"><hi rendition="#italic">August 5,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Empress Frederick, mother of the reigning Emperor, died at Cronberg about 6
                    o’clock this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">White.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
